~ shop
Trader: What would you like to buy?
- Spread Shot (15 coins)
	=> spread
- Heal (20 Coins)
	=> heal 
- Leave
   set Stats.return_to_npc()
    => END!




~ spread
Trader: This will give you the ability to shoot 3 projectiles spread out infront of you, Are you sure?
- Yes
	set Stats.try_buy_spread()
	=> END!
- No
	=> shop

~ heal
Trader: This will give you the ability to Heal 25% of your health, Are you sure?
- Yes
	set Stats.try_buy_heal()
	=> END!
- No
	=> shop

~ success
Trader: Great choice!
=> END!
~ notenough
Trader: Sorry knight, I require more coins.
=> END!
~ already
Trader: You already own this ability.
=> END!
- Leave
    Trader: Come back anytime.
    => END!